{"speciesId":210,"names":{"fr":"Granbull","es":"Granbull","en":"Granbull","ja":"グランブル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is actually timid and easily spooked. If at­ tacked, it flails about to fend off its attacker."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Because its fangs are too heavy, it always keeps its head tilted down. However, its BITE is powerful."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It can make most any POKéMON run away simply by opening its mouth wide to reveal its big fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GRANBULL has a particularly well- developed lower jaw. The enormous fangs are heavy, causing the POKéMON to tip its head back for balance. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite indiscriminately."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"GRANBULL has a particularly well- developed lower jaw. The enormous fangs are heavy, causing the POKéMON to tip its head back for balance. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite indiscriminately."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The huge fangs are heavy, causing it to tilt its head. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Because its fangs are too heavy, it always keeps its head tilted down. However, its BITE is powerful."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is actually timid and easily spooked. If attacked, it flails about to fend off its attacker."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is actually timid and easily spooked. If attacked, it flails about to fend off its attacker."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Because its fangs are too heavy, it always keeps its head tilted down. However, its bite is powerful."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"En dépit des apparences, c’est un grand timide. Quand il s’énerve, il mord de ses énormes crocs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"En dépit des apparences, c’est un grand timide. Quand il s’énerve, il mord de ses énormes crocs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"En dépit des apparences, c’est un grand timide. Quand il s’énerve, il mord de ses énormes crocs."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"A pesar de su aspecto, es muy tímido. Sin embargo, cuando se enfada, ataca con sus colmillos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"顔に 似合わず 臆病。 しかし ひとたび 怒りはじめると 大きな キバで 反撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut faire fuir presque tous les Pokémon en ouvrant très largement sa mâchoire."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Con solo enseñar las fauces, conseguirá ahuyentar prácticamente a todos los Pokémon con los que se cruce."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It can make most any Pokémon run away simply by opening its mouth wide to reveal its big fangs."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大きな 口を 開いて 太い キバを 見せつければ たいていの ポケモンは 逃げ出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Granbull a une mâchoire inférieure particulièrement développée. Ses énormes crocs sont tellement lourds qu’ils l’obligent à pencher la tête. Il ne mord jamais sans raison, sauf quand il a peur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Granbull tiene la mandíbula inferior demasiado desarrollada y colmillos enormes y pesados que le obligan a inclinar la cabeza hacia atrás para compensar el peso. Si no se le asusta, no muerde."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Granbull has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The enormous fangs are heavy, causing the Pokémon to tip its head back for balance. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite indiscriminately."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"下アゴが とても 発達した ポケモン。 キバが 重たいので 首を 傾げている。 驚かさなければ 無暗に かみつかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Granbull a une mâchoire inférieure particulièrement développée. Ses énormes crocs sont tellement lourds qu’ils l’obligent à pencher la tête. Il ne mord jamais sans raison, sauf quand il a peur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Granbull tiene la mandíbula inferior demasiado desarrollada y colmillos enormes y pesados que le obligan a inclinar la cabeza hacia atrás para compensar el peso. Si no se le asusta, no muerde."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Granbull has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The enormous fangs are heavy, causing the Pokémon to tip its head back for balance. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite indiscriminately."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"下アゴが とても 発達した ポケモン。 キバが 重たいので 首を 傾げている。 驚かさなければ 無暗に かみつかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa mâchoire inférieure et ses crocs surdimensionnés sont ses armes de prédilection. Il ne mord pas tant qu’on ne l’énerve pas."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Ataca con su desarrollada mandíbula y sus enormes colmillos. Rara es la vez que muerde a alguien, a menos que le haya hecho enfadar."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its well-developed lower jaw and heavy fangs are its weapons. As long as it’s not provoked, it rarely bites."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"発達した 下アゴと 重たい キバが 武器。 怒らせない限り 滅多に 噛みついたり しないよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Encore plus peureux que Snubbull, son apparence ô combien trompeuse lui vaut un succès fou."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es más miedica que Snubbull. Resulta muy popular entre la gente joven debido a su aspecto de duro y a su afable personalidad."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"More timid than Snubbull, this Pokémon is doted on by young people amused at the contrast between its looks and its attitude."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ブルー 以上に 臆病。 見た目との ギャップが うけて 若い 女性に 大人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa mâchoire est étonnamment puissante, mais comme il n’aime pas se battre, il n’a pas souvent l’occasion de s’en servir."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su mandíbula posee una fuerza abrumadora, pero, como no le gusta pelear, rara vez tiene ocasión de demostrarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"While it has powerful jaws, it doesn’t care for disputes, so it rarely has a chance to display their might."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"アゴの 力は 強力だが 争いを 好まないので 滅多に 披露する 機会は ないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les jeunes gens en sont fous, mais sa timidité et sa grande délicatesse en font un piètre Pokémon de garde."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Es muy popular entre la gente joven, pero su personalidad afable y algo miedosa hacen de él un pésimo guardián."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although it’s popular with young people, 